{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.ColorTubeCoordinates","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.ColorTubeCoordinates","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NoncommRing","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination"],"declarations":24,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.reduced_cubic_of_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.reduced_cubic_of_shifted","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L122-L134","doc":"**Reduced cubic** (`eq:reduced-cubic`). Eliminating `h₂` via the shifted\nquadric turns the shifted cubic\n`h₃ + z(p₁² − 2h₂) + 3z²p₁ + 4z³ = 0` into\n`h₃ + z·p₁² + 5z²p₁ + 8z³ = 0`. The elimination is the ring combination\n`reduced = shifted_cubic + 2z·shifted_quadric`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.shifted_quadric_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.shifted_quadric_iff","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L111-L120","doc":"**Shifted quadric — equivalent forms** (`eq:shifted-quadric`).\n`h₂(c) + z·p₁(c) + 2z² = 0` iff `σ·b + r·g = −z(σ+r+g+b) − 2z²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.spacetime_recovery","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.spacetime_recovery","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L101-L109","doc":"**Spacetime recovery** (`eq:spacetime-recovery`). The Lagrange `z = S/D`\nrelation `z·(χ_ζ − z) = p₁(c) + 4z` rearranges to the quadratic\n`z² − (χ_ζ − 4)·z + p₁(c) = 0` determining the spacetime coordinate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.h3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.h3","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L96-L99","doc":"Hermitian cubic `h₃(c) = σ²·g + b²·r + r²·σ + g²·b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.h2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.h2","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L90-L94","doc":"Hermitian quadric `h₂(c) = σ·b + r·g`\n([`aggregate-color-quantities`](aggregate-color-quantities.md)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.p1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.p1","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L85-L88","doc":"First power sum `p₁(c) = σ + r + g + b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.shifted_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.shifted_sum","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L68-L73","doc":"The sum of all four shifted coordinates equals (w₁ + w₂ + w₃ + w₄) − 4z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.color_recovers_resolvent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.color_recovers_resolvent","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L60-L66","doc":"The color tube coordinates recover the resolvents from z:\nwₖ = cₖ + z for each color coordinate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.colorVector","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.colorVector","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L54-L58","doc":"The color vector is the triple (r, g, b). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.σ_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.σ_eq","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L52-L52","doc":"σ is the shift of w₁ by z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.b_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.b_eq","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L50-L50","doc":"b is the shift of w₄ by z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.g_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.g_eq","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L48-L48","doc":"g is the shift of w₃ by z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.r_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.r_eq","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L46-L46","doc":"r is the shift of w₂ by z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.σ","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Space-like shift σ = w₁ − z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.b","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Blue color tube coordinate b = w₄ − z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.g","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Green color tube coordinate g = w₃ − z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.r","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Red color tube coordinate r = w₂ − z. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₄","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Lagrange resolvent w₄. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₃","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Lagrange resolvent w₃. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₂","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Lagrange resolvent w₂. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.w₁","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Lagrange resolvent w₁. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.z","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Spacetime ratio z = x₀/x₁. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates.mk","kind":"ctor","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.ColorTubeCoordinates","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/color-tube-coordinates.lean#L19-L52","doc":"**Color tube coordinates**: shifted spectral coordinates on Bring's surface.\n\nGiven the spacetime ratio z = x₀/x₁ and Lagrange resolvents w₁, …, w₄,\nthe color tube coordinates are the shifts r = w₂ − z, g = w₃ − z,\nb = w₄ − z, together with the space-like shift σ = w₁ − z.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] Chapter 5, §Color tube coordinates ","signatureChunk":0}]}